			"local_notes": "Lore: The Ordo Malleus hunts daemonic incursion and Chaos worship at its most dangerous, and trains extensively in countermeasures most Inquisitors never learn.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-Ordo flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
