			"id": "TNDiUAihr3N6HnoFr",
			"name": "Ordo: Xenos",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Ordo Xenos studies and counters alien threats and Imperial-xenos contact, from open invasion to quiet infiltration.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-Ordo flavor lens (see this file's `notes`).",
			"tags": [
