				{
					"id": "tMEcGxAO3-UkY_1If",
					"name": "Studies the Enemy Too Closely for Some Tastes",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Ordo Xenos Inquisitors are the ones most often suspected (fairly or not) of Radical sympathies, simply for taking xenos capability seriously enough to study it in depth.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
